/**
 * Creates a CarbonInterval from string.
 *
 * Format:
 *
 * Suffix | Unit    | Example | DateInterval expression
 * -------|---------|---------|------------------------
 * y      | years   |   1y    | P1Y
 * mo     | months  |   3mo   | P3M
 * w      | weeks   |   2w    | P2W
 * d      | days    |  28d    | P28D
 * h      | hours   |   4h    | PT4H
 * m      | minutes |  12m    | PT12M
 * s      | seconds |  59s    | PT59S
